{"name":"滑块","description":"滑块是沿着一段连续或分级范围调整数值的表单控件 · 音量、亮度和价格区间可用滑块调整。应显示范围、当前值并支持键盘操作；需要精确输入 50 等具体数值时，还要提供 数字输入框 Number Input 。","quote":"价格范围想用一根可以拖着走的滑杆来调。","agentPrompt":"请把音量做成 0–100 的滑块，旁边持续显示当前值，拖动时实时更新声音，并支持方向键。测试鼠标、触屏和键盘三种输入，不能只在拖动结束后才生效。","html":"<div class=\"detail-body detail-entry-slider\"><section class=\"detail-hero\" id=\"detail-hero\"><div class=\"dh-head\"><h1>滑块<span>Slider</span></h1></div><div class=\"dh-quote\"><span class=\"dh-quote-label\">你可能会说</span><p class=\"dh-quote-text\">价格范围想用一根可以拖着走的滑杆来调。</p></div><div class=\"dh-tagline\"><strong class=\"dh-summary-lead\">滑块是沿着一段连续或分级范围调整数值的表单控件</strong><span class=\"dh-summary-separator\" aria-hidden=\"true\">·</span><span>音量、亮度和价格区间可用滑块调整。应显示范围、当前值并支持键盘操作；需要精确输入 50 等具体数值时，还要提供 <a class=\"c-ref c-link\" href=\"/vibe-hub/input-number?lang=zh\" data-ref=\"input-number\" aria-label=\"数字输入框 Number Input\">数字输入框 <b>Number Input</b></a>。</span></div><div class=\"dh-demo\"><div class=\"dh-demo-viewport\"><div class=\"dh-demo-inner\"><div class=\"sld-col\">\n        <span class=\"sld-line\">音量<input type=\"range\" class=\"demo-range\" value=\"60\"></span>\n        <span class=\"sld-line\">亮度<input type=\"range\" class=\"demo-range\" value=\"30\"></span>\n      </div></div></div></div></section><div class=\"lesson-extras\"><section class=\"lesson-agent-prompt\" aria-labelledby=\"lesson-agent-title\"><h2 id=\"lesson-agent-title\">你可以这样告诉 AI Agent</h2><blockquote><span class=\"lesson-agent-quote\" aria-hidden=\"true\">“</span><p>请把音量做成 0–100 的滑块，旁边持续显示当前值，拖动时实时更新声音，并支持方向键。测试鼠标、触屏和键盘三种输入，不能只在拖动结束后才生效。</p></blockquote></section></div><div class=\"usage-grid\"><div class=\"usage-box use\"><h3><span class=\"mark\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m5 12.5 4.2 4.2L19 7\"></path></svg></span>什么时候用</h3><ul><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\"><b>音量、亮度</b>这类连续调节</div><div class=\"mk \"><div class=\"mk-row \"><span style=\"color:var(--text-2)\">🔊</span><span class=\"mk-progress\" style=\"width:110px\"><i style=\"width:60%\"></i></span><span style=\"color:var(--text-3)\">60</span></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\"><b>价格区间</b>筛选：双滑块框定范围</div><div class=\"mk \"><div class=\"mk-win\"><div class=\"mk-row \"><span style=\"color:var(--text-3)\">价格</span><span class=\"mk-progress\" style=\"width:110px\"><i style=\"width:50%;margin-left:25%\"></i></span></div><div class=\"mk-row \"><span style=\"color:var(--text-2)\">¥100 — ¥300</span></div></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">调节<b>程度、强度</b>：允许近似选择</div><div class=\"mk \"><div class=\"mk-win\"><div class=\"mk-row \"><span style=\"width:46px;color:var(--text-3)\">创作强度</span><span class=\"mk-progress\" style=\"width:110px\"><i style=\"width:70%\"></i></span><span style=\"color:var(--text-2)\">较强</span></div></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">拖动时<b>实时预览</b>效果</div><div class=\"mk \"><div class=\"mk-row \"><span style=\"color:var(--text-2)\">☀</span><span class=\"mk-progress\" style=\"width:110px\"><i style=\"width:80%\"></i></span></div></div></li></ul></div><div class=\"usage-box dont\"><h3><span class=\"mark\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 7l10 10M17 7 7 17\"></path></svg></span>什么时候不用</h3><ul><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">需要<b>精确到个位</b>：使用 <a class=\"c-ref c-link\" href=\"/vibe-hub/input-number?lang=zh\" data-ref=\"input-number\" aria-label=\"数字输入框 Number Input\">数字输入框 <b>Number Input</b></a></div><div class=\"mk bad\"><div class=\"mk-row \"><span class=\"mk-progress\" style=\"width:110px\"><i style=\"width:63%\"></i></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--red)\">需要精确数值时，应配合数字输入框</span></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">只有<b>少量固定档位</b>：使用 <a class=\"c-ref c-link\" href=\"/vibe-hub/radio?lang=zh\" data-ref=\"radio\" aria-label=\"单选框 Radio\">单选框 <b>Radio</b></a></div><div class=\"mk bad\"><div class=\"mk-row \"><span class=\"mk-progress\" style=\"width:110px\"><i style=\"width:33%\"></i></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--red)\">只有少量离散档位时，可直接列出选项</span></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\"><b>范围跨度很大</b>且难以拖到目标值：配合 <a class=\"c-ref c-link\" href=\"/vibe-hub/input-number?lang=zh\" data-ref=\"input-number\" aria-label=\"数字输入框 Number Input\">数字输入框 <b>Number Input</b></a></div><div class=\"mk bad\"><div class=\"mk-win\"><div class=\"mk-row \"><span class=\"mk-progress\" style=\"width:110px\"><i style=\"width:2%\"></i></span><span style=\"color:var(--text-2)\">2,431 / 100,000</span></div><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--red)\">范围跨度过大，拖动难以定位目标值</span></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">需要<b>选择日期</b>：使用 <a class=\"c-ref c-link\" href=\"/vibe-hub/date-picker?lang=zh\" data-ref=\"date-picker\" aria-label=\"日期选择器 Date Picker\">日期选择器 <b>Date Picker</b></a></div><div class=\"mk bad\"><div class=\"mk-win\"><div class=\"mk-row \"><span class=\"mk-progress\" style=\"width:110px\"><i style=\"width:40%\"></i></span><span style=\"color:var(--text-2)\">7 月 12 日</span></div><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--red)\">日期应使用日期选择器</span></div></div></li></ul></div></div><section><div class=\"section-title\">组成结构 · Anatomy</div><div class=\"anat-wrap\"><div class=\"anat-stage\"><span class=\"sld\"><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"track\"><i class=\"sld-trk\"></i></span><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"fill\"><i class=\"sld-fl\" style=\"width:60%\"></i></span><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"thumb\"><i class=\"sld-th\" style=\"left:calc(60% - 8px)\"></i></span></span>\n          <span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"value\"><b class=\"sld-val\">60</b></span></div><div class=\"anat-parts\"><div class=\"anat-part\" data-ap=\"track\"><button class=\"anat-part-trigger\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span class=\"idx\">1</span><span class=\"pn\">轨道</span><span class=\"pe\">Track</span></button><span class=\"pd\">整段可选范围</span></div><div class=\"anat-part\" data-ap=\"fill\"><button class=\"anat-part-trigger\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span class=\"idx\">2</span><span class=\"pn\">已选部分</span><span class=\"pe\">Fill</span></button><span class=\"pd\">显示当前已选范围</span></div><div class=\"anat-part\" data-ap=\"thumb\"><button class=\"anat-part-trigger\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span class=\"idx\">3</span><span class=\"pn\">手柄</span><span class=\"pe\">Handle</span></button><span class=\"pd\">可拖动，悬停时放大</span></div><div class=\"anat-part\" data-ap=\"value\"><button class=\"anat-part-trigger\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span class=\"idx\">4</span><span class=\"pn\">当前值</span><span class=\"pe\">Value</span></button><span class=\"pd\">拖动时实时跟着变</span></div></div></div></section><section><div class=\"section-title\">常见变体 · Variants</div><div class=\"variant-grid\"><div class=\"variant-card\"><div class=\"variant-name\">默认<span>Default</span></div><div class=\"variant-demo\"><input type=\"range\" class=\"demo-range\" value=\"40\"></div><div class=\"variant-when\">音量、亮度等连续量的调节</div></div><div class=\"variant-card\"><div class=\"variant-name\">双滑块区间<span>Range</span></div><div class=\"variant-demo\"><span class=\"sld-plain\"><i class=\"sld-trk\"></i><i class=\"sld-fl\" style=\"left:25%;width:45%\"></i><i class=\"sld-th\" style=\"left:25%\"></i><i class=\"sld-th\" style=\"left:70%\"></i></span></div><div class=\"variant-when\">要框定起止范围，比如价格带</div></div><div class=\"variant-card\"><div class=\"variant-name\">带刻度<span>With Marks</span></div><div class=\"variant-demo\"><span class=\"sld-marks-wrap\"><input type=\"range\" class=\"demo-range\" value=\"50\"><span class=\"sld-marks\"><span>0</span><span>50</span><span>100</span></span></span></div><div class=\"variant-when\">帮用户对齐几个关键档位</div></div><div class=\"variant-card\"><div class=\"variant-name\">禁用<span>Disabled</span></div><div class=\"variant-demo\"><input type=\"range\" class=\"demo-range\" value=\"70\" disabled></div><div class=\"variant-when\">该调节项当前不可用</div></div></div></section><section class=\"scenes\"><div class=\"section-title\">典型使用场景</div><div class=\"scene-list\"><div class=\"scene-item\"><div class=\"scene-cap\">音量亮度调节</div><div class=\"scene-shot is-plain\"><div class=\"sc-body\"><div class=\"sc-body-inner\"><div style=\"max-width:360px;margin:0 auto;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:12px;padding:12px 14px;box-shadow:var(--shadow-card)\">\n          <div class=\"slider-sc-row\"><span style=\"width:46px\">🔊 音量</span><span class=\"sld-plain\" style=\"flex:1;width:auto\"><i class=\"sld-trk\"></i><i class=\"sld-fl\" style=\"left:0;width:60%\"></i><i class=\"sld-th\" style=\"left:60%\"></i></span><b style=\"width:24px;text-align:right\">60</b></div>\n          <div class=\"slider-sc-row\"><span style=\"width:46px\">☀️ 亮度</span><span class=\"sld-plain\" style=\"flex:1;width:auto\"><i class=\"sld-trk\"></i><i class=\"sld-fl\" style=\"left:0;width:80%\"></i><i class=\"sld-th\" style=\"left:80%\"></i></span><b style=\"width:24px;text-align:right\">80</b></div>\n          <div class=\"slider-sc-row\" style=\"border-bottom:0\"><span style=\"width:46px\">🎧 低音</span><span class=\"sld-plain\" style=\"flex:1;width:auto\"><i class=\"sld-trk\"></i><i class=\"sld-fl\" style=\"left:0;width:35%\"></i><i class=\"sld-th\" style=\"left:35%\"></i></span><b style=\"width:24px;text-align:right\">35</b></div>\n        </div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"scene-item\"><div class=\"scene-cap\">价格区间筛选</div><div class=\"scene-shot is-plain\"><div class=\"sc-body\"><div class=\"sc-body-inner\"><div style=\"max-width:360px;margin:0 auto;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:12px;padding:12px 14px;box-shadow:var(--shadow-card)\">\n          <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:10px\"><b style=\"font-size:13px\">价格区间</b><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\">¥100 — ¥300</span></div>\n          <span class=\"sld-plain\" style=\"width:100%\"><i class=\"sld-trk\"></i><i class=\"sld-fl\" style=\"left:20%;width:40%\"></i><i class=\"sld-th\" style=\"left:20%\"></i><i class=\"sld-th\" style=\"left:60%\"></i></span>\n          <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3);margin-top:2px\"><span>¥0</span><span>¥500</span></div>\n          <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-top:10px\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">已筛选出 86 件商品</span><button class=\"btn btn-primary\">查看结果</button></div>\n        </div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"scene-item\"><div class=\"scene-cap\">图片缩放</div><div class=\"scene-shot is-plain\"><div class=\"sc-body\"><div class=\"sc-body-inner\"><div style=\"max-width:420px;margin:0 auto;display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:center\">\n          <div style=\"flex:1;background:var(--bg-soft);border:1px solid var(--border-light);border-radius:10px;height:116px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;overflow:hidden\">\n            <img src=\"/vibe-hub/source/assets/photo-cat.png\" style=\"width:80%;height:80%;object-fit:cover;border-radius:6px;box-shadow:var(--shadow-card)\" alt=\"\">\n          </div>\n          <div style=\"width:150px;flex-shrink:0\">\n            <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2);margin-bottom:6px\"><span>缩放</span><b>80%</b></div>\n            <span class=\"sld-plain\" style=\"width:100%\"><i class=\"sld-trk\"></i><i class=\"sld-fl\" style=\"left:0;width:80%\"></i><i class=\"sld-th\" style=\"left:80%\"></i></span>\n            <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3);margin-top:2px\"><span>10%</span><span>200%</span></div>\n          </div>\n        </div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"scene-item\"><div class=\"scene-cap\">AI 创作强度</div><div class=\"scene-shot is-plain\"><div class=\"sc-body\"><div class=\"sc-body-inner\"><div style=\"max-width:360px;margin:0 auto;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:12px;padding:12px 14px;box-shadow:var(--shadow-card)\">\n          <div style=\"font-size:13px;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:4px\">🤖 AI 写作设置</div>\n          <div class=\"slider-sc-row\"><span style=\"width:52px\">创作强度</span><span class=\"sld-plain\" style=\"flex:1;width:auto\"><i class=\"sld-trk\"></i><i class=\"sld-fl\" style=\"left:0;width:70%\"></i><i class=\"sld-th\" style=\"left:70%\"></i></span><span class=\"demo-tag blue\">较强</span></div>\n          <div class=\"slider-sc-row\" style=\"border-bottom:0\"><span style=\"width:52px\">回复长度</span><span class=\"sld-plain\" style=\"flex:1;width:auto\"><i class=\"sld-trk\"></i><i class=\"sld-fl\" style=\"left:0;width:40%\"></i><i class=\"sld-th\" style=\"left:40%\"></i></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\">适中</span></div>\n        </div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"oil-ui-pro-recommendation\" aria-label=\"工具与支持\"><a class=\"oil-ui-pro-banner\" href=\"https://ui.oiloil.org/pro/\" target=\"_blank\" aria-label=\"了解 oil-ui-pro 完整版：让 AI 做 UI 设计的 Agent Skill\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"/vibe-hub/source/assets/services/oil-ui-pro-banner-zh.webp\" alt=\"oil-ui-pro：把 AI 的 UI 设计能力，推到极限。完整版多了交互、布局、配图、动效和反复评审。了解完整版。\" width=\"1600\" height=\"560\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></section><section class=\"references-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">延伸阅读 · 权威出处</div><div class=\"reference-list\"><a class=\"reference-link\" href=\"https://www.w3.org/WAI/ARIA/apg/patterns/slider/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span class=\"reference-title\">滑块模式</span><span class=\"reference-source\">WAI-ARIA APG ↗</span></a></div></section></div>","sourceUrl":"https://vibe-hub.org/slider","markdown":"# 滑块Slider\n\n你可能会说\n价格范围想用一根可以拖着走的滑杆来调。\n\n**滑块是沿着一段连续或分级范围调整数值的表单控件**·音量、亮度和价格区间可用滑块调整。应显示范围、当前值并支持键盘操作；需要精确输入 50 等具体数值时，还要提供 [数字输入框 **Number Input**](/vibe-hub/input-number?lang=zh)。\n\n## 你可以这样告诉 AI Agent\n\n> “\n> 请把音量做成 0–100 的滑块，旁边持续显示当前值，拖动时实时更新声音，并支持方向键。测试鼠标、触屏和键盘三种输入，不能只在拖动结束后才生效。\n\n### 什么时候用\n\n- **音量、亮度**这类连续调节\n\n🔊60\n- **价格区间**筛选：双滑块框定范围\n\n价格\n\n¥100 — ¥300\n- 调节**程度、强度**：允许近似选择\n\n创作强度较强\n- 拖动时**实时预览**效果\n\n☀\n\n### 什么时候不用\n\n- 需要**精确到个位**：使用 [数字输入框 **Number Input**](/vibe-hub/input-number?lang=zh)\n\n需要精确数值时，应配合数字输入框\n- 只有**少量固定档位**：使用 [单选框 **Radio**](/vibe-hub/radio?lang=zh)\n\n只有少量离散档位时，可直接列出选项\n- **范围跨度很大**且难以拖到目标值：配合 [数字输入框 **Number Input**](/vibe-hub/input-number?lang=zh)\n\n2,431 / 100,000\n范围跨度过大，拖动难以定位目标值\n- 需要**选择日期**：使用 [日期选择器 **Date Picker**](/vibe-hub/date-picker?lang=zh)\n\n7 月 12 日\n日期应使用日期选择器\n\n组成结构 · Anatomy\n\n**60**\n\n1轨道Track整段可选范围\n\n2已选部分Fill显示当前已选范围\n\n3手柄Handle可拖动，悬停时放大\n\n4当前值Value拖动时实时跟着变\n\n常见变体 · Variants\n\n默认Default\n\n音量、亮度等连续量的调节\n\n双滑块区间Range\n\n要框定起止范围，比如价格带\n\n带刻度With Marks\n\n050100\n\n帮用户对齐几个关键档位\n\n禁用Disabled\n\n该调节项当前不可用\n\n典型使用场景\n\n音量亮度调节\n\n🔊 音量**60**\n\n          \n☀️ 亮度**80**\n\n          \n🎧 低音**35**\n\n价格区间筛选\n\n**价格区间**¥100 — ¥300\n\n          \n          \n¥0¥500\n\n          \n已筛选出 86 件商品查看结果\n\n图片缩放\n\n缩放**80%**\n\n            \n            \n10%200%\n\nAI 创作强度\n\n🤖 AI 写作设置\n\n          \n创作强度较强\n\n          \n回复长度适中\n\n延伸阅读 · 权威出处\n\n[滑块模式WAI-ARIA APG ↗](https://www.w3.org/WAI/ARIA/apg/patterns/slider/)"}